  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia - Addis Ababa Sewerage II Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">&#xc9;thiopie - Projet d&apos;assainissement II d&apos;Addis-Abeba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims at completing the first phase sewerage development in Addis Ababa and will enhance the technical feasibility and financial viability of the overall sewerage development in the city. Funds will be made available for training the staff for the management, opration and maintenance of the sewerage system, on completion. The project will also determine the  causes of high water losses in the water supply and distribution system.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
